]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7c4f7ce0-d3b5-11f1-a302-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261029-130810-131417-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7c4f7ce0-d3b5-11f1-a302-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261029-130810-131417-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">81bbd4f8-d3b5-11f1-aff0-6bbdf03f827f</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:15:50 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>DR Congo: A centre celebrates the discharge of last Ebola patients</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261029-dr-congo-a-centre-celebrates-the-discharge-of-last-ebola-patients</link><description>
