</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7ce8eed6-d39f-11f1-b370-399efcf9f4d0/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-d29755f5.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7ce8eed6-d39f-11f1-b370-399efcf9f4d0/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-d29755f5.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">eaa89036-d3a2-11f1-806a-81dc92d41434</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:29:20 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Olivia SALAZAR WINSPEAR</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Flavio Bolsonaro’s great escape: Is this the beginning of the end for ‘Bolsonarism’?</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261029-flavio-bolsonaro-s-great-escape-is-this-the-beginning-of-the-end-for-bolsonarism</link><description>
